Hey everyone, thanks so much to everyone who's played Uncanny Tales: Cold Road and left feedback!
I’ve just released a small update based on your responses:

🔧 What’s new:

✅ Items and interactive objects are now highlighted — no more guessing what you can use;

✅ Small bugs and issues fixed;

✅ The second half of the game is now a bit easier;

✅ The enemy is less aggressive in the final section — you’ve got a better shot at surviving 😉

Thank you so much for the support and feedback — it means a lot ❤️
If you enjoyed the game, please consider leaving a review — it really helps!
